the gi joe movie franchise has been  missing in action but if there's one guy  who can rescue it it's the ninja known  as snake eyes  the character is returning in an all-new  series reboot here's everything you need  to know about snake eyes gi joe origins  the first bit of news about the snake  eyes movie that the public heard came  out over three years ago way back in may  2018  at the time the hollywood reporter  confirmed that paramount pictures had  put into development to gi joe's  spin-off film centered around snake eyes  tapping the live-action beauty and the  beast movie screenwriter evan  spilatopoulos to pen the script and  brian goldner to produce  the outlet also noted that executives at  paramount and hasbro had been keen on  rebooting the gi joe franchise and it  commissioned a writer's room dedicated  to developing movies and cinematic  universes around hasbro properties  including gi joe transformers mask and  micronauts  by all accounts the snake eye solo flake  was one such idea  and according to an interview producer  lorenzo d bonaventura gave to  entertainment weekly in 2021 it was one  of the only solid  ideas that writer's room happened to  produce things were relatively quiet on  the snake eyes front until december 2018  when robert schwenke signed on as the  film's director audiences will know  schwenke is the director behind movies  like the time traveler's wife  ripd the divergent series insurgent and  the divergent series allegiant  in 2010's gi joe the rise of cobra in  2013's gi joe retaliation  the scottish martial artist ray park  played snake eyes in december 2018  gi joe franchise producer lorenzo de  bonaventura confirmed with slash film  that ray park wouldn't be reprising his  role for the character's origin story  leaving the possibilities for the movie  wide open  it wasn't until mid 2019 that the snake  eyes gi joe origins cast started to come  together  and a few more months after that before  the movie kicked off production  so if rey park isn't snake eyes then who  is that'd be malaysian english actor  henry golding  whose performance is nick young in the  beloved romantic comedy crazy rich  asians has led to roles in the feature  films of simple faber monsoon  last christmas and the gentleman through  snake eye's gi joe origins a talented  actor will be taken on his first leading  role in an action movie and he has a  heck of a supporting cast surrounding  him  snake eyes also stars ready or not and  bill and ted face the music actress  samara weaving as scarlet a fierce gi  joe agent who also works for clan arashi  kage  money high star ursula cabarro as the  baroness a member of the terrorist  organization cobra  peter mencha of marvel's agents of  shield fame as clan arashi kage's  co-leader blind master  andrew koji of the excellent cinematic  series warrior as snake eyes friend  turned deadly nemesis storm shadow and  haruka abe as akiko a clan arashi kage  trainee with connections to snake eyes  and storm shadow rounding out the cast  of snake eyes our eco aways to storm  shadow's uncle hard master  who leads clan arashi kage takihiro hira  as cobra member kenta  and steven ulrich as snake eyes father  playing a character as famous as snake  eyes and a franchise as action heavy as  gi joe would require  even in shape actors to get more ripped  in preparation henry golding whom no one  would consider unmuscular in his  everyday life got totally shredded to  play snake eyes  undergoing intense training that yielded  impressive results  in november 2020 golding said that he  became a weapon during snake eyes gi joe  origins prep  and even shared a jaw-dropping clip from  one of his training sessions on the  tonight show with jimmy fallon  they put me through my paces we have  like four hours of choreography  every single day we have two hours of  script work then like an  hour of pt according to golding the  producers of snake eyes went out on a  limb and casting him having faith that  he would be able to build on his boxing  and martial arts background to become a  credible super soldier  that bat seems to have paid off in a big  way it was worth it because  i became a weapon i'm not gonna lie the  snake ice gi joe origins cast and crew  began filming in october 2019  shooting in vancouver canada from the  15th of that month to the 9th of  december  when vancouver's shooting rap the  production moved to a new locale  tokyo japan the cast and crew spent  about six weeks in japan and in late  february 2020 golden announced that all  principal photography for snake eyes was  complete  writing in an instagram post and that is  a principle wrap on snake eyes ladies  and gents  what a crew we have vancouver in japan  you are unstoppable thank you for the  dedication this film is going to blow  everyone's socks off  initially snake eyes was slated for a  theatrical release on march 27  2020. like many movies originally slated  for that year it ended up going through  some release date reshuffling  eventually being taken off of  paramount's release schedule entirely  over a year later in march 2021 golden  came forward with another announcement  about filming  snake eyes was undergoing reshoots in an  instagram post about the reshoots golden  acknowledged the difficulty of filming  under covet protocols and expressed his  happiness that they were still able to  pull it off in spite of it  we just got some reshoots for snake eyes  but i'm so grateful that we're able to  pull this off  after those last minute reshoots the  film is now officially set to land in  theaters on july 23  2021. first and foremost snake eyes will  be an origin story and as such fans will  get to see the events that transform him  into the masked silent badass they know  and love  in the gi joe animated series and in the  marvel comics snake eyes  silence has been chalked up to damage  vocal chords but that fact was retconned  for the feature films  snake eyes doesn't say a word in gi joe  the rise of cobra and gi joe retaliation  because he previously took a vow of  silence following the apparent murder of  one of his masters at the hands of storm  shadow the film's story will focus on  snake eyes accepting an invitation to  begin training with the arashi kage a  clan of japanese ninja  the process will prove more difficult  than anyone bargained for as the truth  about snake eyes pass comes to the  surface  his mind and harder tested and his body  is pushed to its limits  of course with storm shadow as a key  member of the character roster there  should be an epic showdown between the  dangerous man and his former friend  snake eyes  remarks that star henry golding has made  indicate that snake eyes will be charged  with a weighty task  rebooting the entire gi joe film series  during a press conference in january  2020 the actor said  the movie is unlike anything people will  have seen we're really starting a new  timeline a new franchise within the gi  joe universe  to kick it off with such a distinct and  stylized film i think it really sets the  precedent for follow-up movies  while one could make the case that  paramounts at hasbro are jumping the gun  by rebooting the series after only two  films it seems like a smart move  gi joe has the potential to be a smash  hit property along the lines of the fast  and furious and mission impossible  franchises  but it hasn't happened yet previous  entries in the franchise rise of cobra  and retaliation  underperformed critically and  commercially in his past comments  golding perhaps inadvertently pinned  down one big reason for this  a lack of personality snake eyes can fix  that reintroducing the franchise by way  of an origin flick for its most  compelling and unique character  those thanksgi joe origins has yet to  open in theaters paramount and hasbro  executives already have a sequel in the  works  a hollywood reporter broke the news in  an exclusive report on may 1st 2020  detailing that rebecca and seberg  writers joe shrapnel and anna waterhouse  teamed up to co-write the script for  snake eyes 2.  lorenzo d bonaventura is returning to  produce and of course henry golding is  circling back to star with snake eyes  there isn't a whole lot of information  about the snake eye sequel out there  just yet  and vans will have to wait to see the  first flick to know what might happen in  a second  it stands to reason that snake eye's gi  joe origins could end with its eponymous  character taking a vow of silence or  venturing to never show his face again  although doing both while canonically  accurate might make for an underwhelming  follow-up film  lucasfilm's disney plus streaming series  the mandalorian proved that a project's  main character doesn't have to show  their face at all times pedro pascal's  din jaren almost never takes his helmet  off but that they should at least speak  up every now and then keep things  interesting there's also bonus points of  course for the masked character showing  some wit and humor when they do engage  in conversation how will fans feel if  snake eyes hides his face but not his  voice or vice versa  instead of doing both down the line in  any case it says a lot  that paramounts on hasbro greenlit a  sequel well before snake eyes debuted  fingers crossed that when snake eyes gi  joe origins debuts on july 23rd  it'll blow everyone away check out one  of our newest videos right here  plus even more looper videos about your  favorite movies and tv shows are coming  soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

